  <title>2.1.2: Self Check</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00371</md:content-id>
    <md:title>2.1.2: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>38a82e9e-7976-4be5-8a9e-95a5287e7e7c</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para>A school group bought 12 tickets to visit a history museum.</para>
<list>
  <item>Adult tickets are $5 each.</item>
  <item>Student tickets are $8 each.</item>
</list>
<para>The school paid a total of $90. How many adult tickets, \(x\), and student tickets, \(y\), did the school buy?</para></section>
</content>
</document>
